560x1440-C.png", "id": "905966224922640", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974900_905966228255973_5130841505886610815_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=02f5mzdBf2QQ7kNvwENzJH6&_nc_oc=Adq-v1Hv7EWl7ZN5qd2mR70pfpTWJaYZmtj4JdqpdLZclW3HHGCqA_Grf5g09aMhSZM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMC60LSnfAbFwtW44lnJqERjFKz13u1ZShLf0dtvbRsbQ&oe=6ACA44CB"}, {"file_name": "SA-LS-Launch-Meta-Screenshot-2560x1440-G.png", "id": "523141100328151", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031339_523141106994817_8586809118821300384_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1DLN_o2rXG4Q7kNvwHKzxWf&_nc_oc=Adr73c334jjMiXI2BEmXOhhVwhFTAl9bYX9-C3QIpKuLhoHKnABf71vELXjSiQ5-HZY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP9q4Tik6THjKCMA58MLm-VJLdtgHXLm0NONvTQplsDyA&oe=6ACA5DB5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SA-LS-Meta-VideoCover-2560x1440.png", "id": "8770630689667401", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982555_8770630713000732_6259191283680804636_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_aid=0&_nc_ohc=ng4lIC8zOh8Q7kNvwH34x_Y&_nc_oc=Adq8rQTPBz0vxBauGDIeyDYDHuZAhXBaoo3ScF3-HI8FYNtiM0JlEnQfMnG3EQF7F4A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM0AoiSUq2tQ3QpR6uhOqSozo_crAwY-RxDgl2qnojXGA&oe=6ACA6F68"}, "display_name": "Last Stand", "keywords": ["pvp", "shoot", "horror", "action", "duel"], "long_description": "Step into the future of mixed reality with Last Stand, from the makers of Drop Dead: The Cabin. This is the world\u2019s first multi-location mixed reality PvP shootout. Your living room becomes a battlefield as you eliminate your opponent while fending off a relentless zombie invasion. Move, dodge, and take cover in a fully immersive combat zone.\n\n{1067517198339345}\n\n**1v1 Mixed Reality PvP Combat**\n\nBattle opponents from anywhere\u2014each player fights from their own home. Turn your living room into a battlefield, outsmarting rivals with real-world strategy.\n\n{1232934048025689}\n\n**Precision Full-Body Tracking**\n\nDodge bullets like in The Matrix or land headshots like John Wick! Our full-body tracking ensures every movement feels accurate and responsive, immersing you deeply in the action.\n\n{428700763582659}\n\n**Your Room, Your Advantage**\n\nTransform your living room from a Netflix haven into a tactical stronghold. Your couch becomes a fortress; your table, a shield. Outsmart and outmaneuver\u2014your home is part of the fight!\n\n{1127967098666563}\n\n**Cinematic Shootouts at Home**\n\nExperience intense gunfights and explosive combat, with dynamic destruction shaping every encounter. With dynamic destruction, every round is as intense as a blockbuster.\n\n**Last Stand is an early access title pushing the boundaries of mixed reality. Join our community on Discord to share feedback and help us shape the future of the game.**\n\nVisit **LastStandXR.com** to learn more and join the discord.", "short_description": "Step into the future of mixed reality with Last Stand, from the makers of Drop Dead: The Cabin. This is the world\u2019s first multi-location mixed reality PvP shootout. Your living room becomes a battlefield as you eliminate your opponent while fending off a relentless zombie invasion. Move, dodge, and take cover in a fully interactive, immersive combat zone."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://soulassembly.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Soul Assembly", "support_website_url": "https://Laststandxr.com/", "website_url": "https://Laststandxr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type":